---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Full Stack</h2>
		<p>Java/Spring Boot back-end and Angular/React front-end development. TypeScript, RxJS, NgRx, ThreeJS, and Ionic for cross-platform experiences.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="trophy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Technical Leadership</h2>
		<p>Leading a team of 5 developers with Scrum methodology, architecture decisions, code reviews, and a structured training program.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Architecture</h2>
		<p>Domain-Driven Design, Hexagonal Architecture, micro-frontends with Nx and Module Federation, and CI/CD pipeline design.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
		transition: box-shadow var(--transition-medium), transform var(--transition-medium), border-color var(--transition-medium);
	}

	.box:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		border-color: var(--accent-regular);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--fg-subtle);
	}

	.skills :global(svg) {
		transition: transform var(--transition-medium);
	}

	.box:hover :global(svg) {
		transform: scale(1.1);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 5rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}
	}
</style>
